# Build mode used ONLY by the Playwright ANN e2e suite (`npm run build:e2e-ann`).
# Selects the read-only ANN v1 adapter over the deterministic SIMULATED in-memory
# mock feed. No network, no Assembly Nexus system, no credentials.
# VITE_* values are compiled into the client bundle: never put secrets here.
VITE_FORGE_ADAPTER=ann-mock
